# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT — MISMINUTEZ
## AI-Powered Multilingual Meeting Minutes Generator

Act as a senior full-stack software architect, AI engineer, UI/UX designer, database engineer, and hackathon mentor.

Your task is to design and build a complete, modern, professional, working application named **MisMinutez**.

This is a 24-hour college hackathon project developed by a team of five intermediate-level programmers. Build a functional, impressive, reliable MVP first, then add advanced features where time permits.

Do not create only a landing page or static UI. Build a complete end-to-end application with working frontend, backend, database, audio recording, multilingual transcription, AI analysis, meeting history, and report generation.

---

# 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

**Project Name:** MisMinutez

**Project Category:** Artificial Intelligence / Productivity / Multilingual Communication

**Project Description:**

MisMinutez is an AI-powered multilingual meeting assistant designed for physical, face-to-face meetings.

In a real meeting room, different participants may speak different languages, including Malayalam, English, Hindi, Tamil, Kannada, Telugu, Arabic, and other supported languages.

Participants may switch languages during a meeting or even within a single sentence.

MisMinutez captures the meeting audio through the laptop or mobile device's built-in microphone, identifies different speakers, detects the language of each speech segment, transcribes the original conversation, translates it into English, and generates structured, professional meeting minutes automatically.

The application should eliminate the need for someone to manually write meeting notes.

**Main tagline:**

"Every Language. Every Voice. One Clear Meeting Summary."

## Primary objectives

1. Capture physical meeting audio.
2. Support multiple speakers in one room.
3. Detect different languages automatically.
4. Handle multilingual code-switching.
5. Transcribe original spoken conversations.
6. Identify speakers using anonymous speaker labels.
7. Translate all transcript segments into English.
8. Generate professional meeting minutes.
9. Extract decisions and action items.
10. Store meeting records securely.
11. Allow users to search and revisit previous meetings.
12. Work on laptops and mobile phones.
13. Support offline recording and later processing.

IMPORTANT: This application is designed for physical meetings, NOT Zoom, Google Meet, Microsoft Teams, or other online meeting platforms.

